const n='---\ntitle: "Qingpu 租户授权 Key"\ndescription: "Qingpu 主题私有的租户授权 key 签发、轮换、吊销与校验接口"\n---\n\n# Qingpu 租户授权 Key API\n\n本模块为 `qingpu` 主题提供了一套私有 PostgreSQL 实现，用于管理租户授权 key。它不会向全局 `server/db/schema.*` 写入任何额外表结构。\n\n## 初始化步骤\n\n1. 配置 `QINGPU_DATABASE_URL`，或者直接复用 `DATABASE_URL`。\n2. 执行 `app/themes/qingpu/database/tenant_authorization_keys.sql` 中的建表 SQL。\n3. 通过 `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/*` 调用对应接口。\n\n## 存储约定\n\n- 原始 API key 只会在创建和轮换时返回一次。\n- 数据库只保存 `api_key_hash` 与 `api_key_prefix`，不保存明文密钥。\n- `subscriptionId` 用于关联 APayShop 订阅，`subscriptionSnapshot` 用于保留签发时的套餐快照。\n\n---\n\n## 1. 获取租户授权 Key 列表\n\n- **请求地址**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys`\n- **请求方法**: `GET`\n- **权限要求**: 已登录用户\n\n### 成功响应\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": [\n    {\n      "id": 12,\n      "userId": 7,\n      "subscriptionId": "sub_123",\n      "productId": 3,\n      "orderId": "ORD20260706001",\n      "tenantName": "Acme Team",\n      "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n      "keyLabel": "production",\n      "apiKeyPreview": "qpk_live_bd30c7****************",\n      "status": "active",\n      "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",\n      "issuedAt": "2026-07-06T09:00:00.000Z",\n      "lastUsedAt": null,\n      "revokedAt": null,\n      "revokedReason": null,\n      "meta": {\n        "env": "prod"\n      },\n      "subscriptionSnapshot": {\n        "productName": "Qingpu Pro",\n        "interval": "month"\n      },\n      "createdAt": "2026-07-06T09:00:00.000Z",\n      "updatedAt": "2026-07-06T09:00:00.000Z"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. 创建租户授权 Key\n\n- **请求地址**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys`\n- **请求方法**: `POST`\n- **权限要求**: 已登录用户\n\n### 请求体\n\n```json\n{\n  "tenantName": "Acme Team",\n  "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n  "keyLabel": "production",\n  "subscriptionId": "sub_123",\n  "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z",\n  "orderId": "ORD20260706001",\n  "meta": {\n    "env": "prod"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 成功响应\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Tenant key created successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n    "status": "active",\n    "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"\n  },\n  "rawKey": "qpk_live_3bfc7f4d4fdd2ef8..."\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. 获取租户授权 Key 详情\n\n- **请求地址**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/detail?id=12`\n- **请求方法**: `GET`\n- **权限要求**: 已登录用户\n\n### 成功响应\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "userId": 7,\n    "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n    "status": "active",\n    "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. 轮换租户授权 Key\n\n- **请求地址**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/rotate`\n- **请求方法**: `POST`\n- **权限要求**: 已登录用户\n\n### 请求体\n\n```json\n{\n  "id": 12,\n  "expiresAt": "2026-08-15T00:00:00.000Z"\n}\n```\n\n### 成功响应\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Tenant key rotated successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "status": "active"\n  },\n  "rawKey": "qpk_live_71f2f31554ce3fd5..."\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. 吊销租户授权 Key\n\n- **请求地址**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/revoke`\n- **请求方法**: `POST`\n- **权限要求**: 已登录用户\n\n### 请求体\n\n```json\n{\n  "id": 12,\n  "reason": "Tenant offboarded"\n}\n```\n\n### 成功响应\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "message": "Tenant key revoked successfully",\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "status": "revoked",\n    "revokedReason": "Tenant offboarded"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 6. 校验租户授权 Key\n\n- **请求地址**: `/api/qingpu/tenant-keys/verify`\n- **请求方法**: `POST`\n- **权限要求**: 无需登录\n\n### 请求体\n\n```json\n{\n  "apiKey": "qpk_live_3bfc7f4d4fdd2ef8...",\n  "tenantCode": "acme-team"\n}\n```\n\n### 成功响应\n\n```json\n{\n  "code": 0,\n  "valid": true,\n  "data": {\n    "id": 12,\n    "userId": 7,\n    "subscriptionId": "sub_123",\n    "tenantCode": "acme-team",\n    "status": "active",\n    "expiresAt": "2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 错误响应\n\n```json\n{\n  "statusCode": 401,\n  "message": "Tenant key has expired"\n}\n```\n';export{n as default};
